---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About . ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About MidMon. Predictive maintenance for mid-market manufacturers." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-44">
			<section class="container-x">
				<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
					<span class="section-eyebrow">About</span>
					<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">
						MidMon is built for the <span class="text-accent">plants the incumbents ignore</span>.
					</h1>
					<p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
						Predictive maintenance for the 30,000+ mid-market plants in Canada and the US
						Northeast that operate between 50 and 500 critical assets and can\u2019t justify a
						seven-figure enterprise deployment.
					</p>

					<div class="mt-12 space-y-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
						<p>
							We started MidMon at Concordia University in 2025. Six undergraduate engineers,
							each in a named leadership role in IEEE or CSME, each owning one of the
							disciplines the platform depends on.
						</p>
						<p>
							The technical idea is straightforward: run the anomaly model on the sensor
							itself, in under 5 watts. No cloud round-trip. No data team on the customer
							side.
						</p>
						<p>
							The product idea is simpler. The mid-market doesn\u2019t need a managed service.
							It needs a sensor it can bolt on in fifteen minutes that sends a plain-language
							alert when something is about to fail.
						</p>
						<p>
							That\u2019s what we\u2019re building. If you run a plant, invest in industrial AI, or
							want to help us build it, <a class="text-white underline decoration-[#2dd4bf]/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[#2dd4bf]" href="/#contact">get in touch</a>.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
						<a href="/#how" class="btn btn-primary">See how it works</a>
						<a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Talk to the team</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
